			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1970253">
									

<p>Yes, i would like to volunteer to design an experiment which uses d-class personnel to better understand this anomaly. Even without knowledge of what the document is.</p>
<p>Next time an instance of 1693-1 dies, someone involved in the project is going to realize: &quot;Hey, this guy took way too long to die if this is like alzheimers. Something is wrong with our understanding of this object. When things are unknown about anomalies, problems occur. Request permission to run an autopsy on former instance (which are understood to be non-infectious). Find out there's no degeneration of tissue. Inform O5 there is something seriously wrong with our containment procedures, as instances of 1693-1 are not being properly infected. Request permission to perform further experiments with mute (natural or artificial, doesn't matter) D-class. Perform experiments with speech-to-text. Determine none of the d-class exhibit the infection by PET scan. Entire SCP falls apart.&quot;</p>
<p>Scientists despise the unknown, and Bureaucrats don't want things sneaking up on them (that's why bureaucracy exists). This charade would be discovered within 4 months.</p>

							</div>

								
					
