														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1970326">
									

<p>It's been a long time since I've read the article that could be 'loop-holing' the Foundation and the system essentially tricking itself into the situation of, in my own words: job's done, waste of resources to handle further based on calculations, lock it in the vault now!</p>
<p>I'm left wondering if it's just some class D's working the system in which the system failed in it's observational/handling protocol.</p>
<p>It could be that all of the fear in the CDC is worthwhile and behind that box's confinements is a single man(/woman) who's escape/'displacement' could result in a titanic use of/loss of resources just to repair the damage of the suggested pandemic scenario.</p>
<p>And another thought that I didn't envision until re-reading the article&#8230;what if the original strain was stolen, and the class Ds are working the system&#8230;at the same time&#8230;Double-Wammy. The skill required of someone getting through the securities required to obtain it must have had to be perfected, and I mean that. So if they did, whoever stole it would already have a benefitting player on the board who gets a lifetime of well&#8230;life since they made the good doctors believe in forgetfulness. The class Ds. So entertaining that extremely unlikely yet still probable case in this list of what the hell is in that box, I want to know, best effect in this article, <strong>I WANT TO KNOW.</strong></p>
<p>I loved this article, the message pasted from generation of class D to D was amazing as well, a lot of great work put into it, and a seriously gripping trail of possibilities. +1! Again I'm sure that many will not believe such feats could be accomplished&#8230;but then again&#8230;</p>

